## Model card

- **Name:** Mercury 2.5
- **Short description:** Inception Labs’ Mercury 2.5 is a closed-weights diffusion LLM (260K context) focused on high-throughput/low-latency reasoning and tool-structured workflows.
- **Provider / access:** Inception Labs API / hosted providers. Local metadata lists `inception/mercury-2.5`, pricing $0.20/$0.75 per 1M (list) with cached pricing, and notes closure to new users on 2026-10-19 (superseded by Mercury 3).
- **Release / knowledge:** Inception Labs docs reviewed 2026-11-10. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed source.
- **IDs:** `mercury-2.5`, `inception/mercury-2.5`.
- **Context window:** 260,000 tokens total (65,536 max output).
- **Modalities:** Text input/output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.20/$0.75 per 1M in/out list ($0.02 cached) per metadata/docs; launch/lower prices may appear on some providers.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary diffusion LLM (closed weights). Architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

